 "title": "四个声调",
 "en": "The four tones",
 "intro": "Before a child says a word, they have the melody. Mandarin has four tones plus a light neutral tone, and tones change in a few predictable places (tone sandhi). This unit trains your ear and mouth until tones are automatic. Pinyin in the app shows the tone as it is SPOKEN; a dotted underline means the written tone changed (hover/long-press shows the dictionary tone).",
