 "texts": [
  {
   "id": "t.s1u01.1",
   "kind": "rhyme",
   "title": "声调歌",
   "src": "traditional classroom chant",
   "lines": [
    {
     "zh": "一声平，",
     "p": "yī shēng píng",
     "en": "Tone one is level,"
    },
    {
     "zh": "二声扬，",
     "p": "èr shēng yáng",
     "en": "tone two rises,"
    },
    {
     "zh": "三声拐弯，",
     "p": "sān shēng guǎi wān",
     "en": "tone three turns a corner,"
    },
    {
     "zh": "四声降。",
     "p": "sì shēng jiàng",
     "en": "tone four falls."
    }
   ],
   "notes": [
    "Every Chinese first-grader chants this while drawing the tone marks in the air: ā (flat line), á (up), ǎ (a check mark), à (down).",
    "拐弯 guǎi wān: to turn a corner. 降 jiàng: to come down."
   ],
   "qs": [
    {
     "q": "哪个声调是「降」？ Which tone falls?",
     "o": [
      "一声",
      "二声",
      "三声",
      "四声"
     ],
     "a": 3
    },
    {
     "q": "「三声拐弯」 describes which mark?",
     "o": [
      "ā",
      "á",
      "ǎ",
      "à"
     ],
     "a": 2
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t.s1u01.2",
   "kind": "rhyme",
   "title": "妈妈骑马（绕口令）",
   "src": "traditional tongue twister",
   "lines": [
    {
     "zh": "妈妈骑马，",
     "p": "mā ma qí mǎ",
     "en": "Mom rides a horse,"
    },
    {
     "zh": "马慢，",
     "p": "mǎ màn",
     "en": "the horse is slow,"
    },
    {
     "zh": "妈妈骂马。",
     "p": "mā ma mà mǎ",
     "en": "Mom scolds the horse."
    },
    {
     "zh": "马不慢，",
     "p": "mǎ bù màn",
     "en": "Then the horse isn't slow,"
    },
    {
     "zh": "妈妈不骂马。",
     "p": "mā ma bù mà mǎ",
     "en": "and Mom doesn't scold the horse."
    }
   ],
   "notes": [
    "绕口令 rào kǒu lìng: tongue twister. This one is all about ma in four tones.",
    "骑 qí: to ride (astride). 慢 màn: slow.",
    "Notice 不慢 and 不骂: 不 becomes bú before a 4th tone."
   ],
   "qs": [
    {
     "q": "妈妈为什么骂马？ Why does Mom scold the horse?",
     "o": [
      "马慢",
      "马快",
      "马不吃"
     ],
     "a": 0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t.s1u01.3",
   "kind": "rhyme",
   "title": "你好，小老虎",
   "src": "original rhyme for this app",
   "lines": [
    {
     "zh": "你好，你好，小老虎！",
     "p": "nǐ hǎo nǐ hǎo xiǎo lǎo hǔ",
     "en": "Hello, hello, little tiger!"
    },
    {
     "zh": "不是猫，不是狗，",
     "p": "bù shì māo bù shì gǒu",
     "en": "Not a cat, not a dog,"
    },
    {
     "zh": "一个一个一起走。",
     "p": "yī gè yī gè yī qǐ zǒu",
     "en": "one by one we walk together."
    },
    {
     "zh": "一天走到老师家，",
     "p": "yī tiān zǒu dào lǎo shī jiā",
     "en": "One day we walk to the teacher's house,"
    },
    {
     "zh": "老师说：“你们好！”",
     "p": "lǎo shī shuō nǐ men hǎo",
     "en": "the teacher says: 'Hello, everyone!'"
    }
   ],
   "notes": [
    "Every line hides a sandhi: 你好 ní hǎo, 小老虎 xiáo láo hǔ, 不是 bú shì, 一个 yí gè, 一起 yì qǐ, 一天 yì tiān.",
    "老师 and 老虎 both start with a 3rd tone. Before 师 (tone 1) it is a low half-third; before 虎 (tone 3) it becomes tone 2."
   ],
   "qs": [
    {
     "q": "「一起」怎么读？",
     "o": [
      "yī qǐ",
      "yì qǐ",
      "yí qǐ"
     ],
     "a": 1
    },
    {
     "q": "「小老虎」怎么读？",
     "o": [
      "xiǎo lǎo hǔ",
      "xiáo láo hǔ",
      "xiáo lǎo hú"
     ],
     "a": 1
    }
   ]
  }
 ],
